WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.210
Victim Was a 36-Year-Old Maid

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.210
Another Maid Feud?

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.290
What Will Become of Akiba?

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.790
Get over here, you!

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.040
Get!

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:52.170
Miss Nagi, this is the maid who offed Ranko Mannen.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:54.420
One of my maids got hold of her.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:56.210
Which cafe is she from?

00:00:56.210 --> 00:01:00.540
From Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam, the one that Ranko Mannen
wiped out right after getting out of the joint.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.080
Do you have any idea what you've done?

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:05.080
I'm not a Creature!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:06.710
Or an axolotl, either!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:08.880
I'm a black space bunny!

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.920
Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam is the only place I belong!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.460
So you wanted revenge?

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.880
Boss, should she sleep with the fishes in Kanda River?

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:18.920
Boss?

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:21.380
An "enjoyable" maid cafe?
Very funny.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.460
You can release her.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:24.460
But...

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.920
Don't make me say it twice.

00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:27.040
A-all right...

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.500
Yap all you want.
You're a Creature now.

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.540
Let's see you prove your worth.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.880
Wh-what do you mean?

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:41.630
Now that it's come to this, we go whole ham.

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.710
It's all out war.

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.460
Final Episode

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:49.460
At Moe's End

00:01:55.960 --> 00:01:57.170
Look, maids.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:00.000
I really wish they wouldn't use the same funeral hall.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.960
It's another gang war casualty, isn't it?

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:10.210
Memorial Service

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:10.210
Venue for the

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:10.210
Late Ranko Mannen

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:05.080
Apparently this maid got out of prison
less than a year ago.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:06.500
I bet she deserved it.

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.210
I just wish Akiba could be rid of all these maid cafes.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.040
What are the police doing?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:13.540
Not so loud!

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:16.000
You never know what they'll do if they hear us!

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.250
Did you hear Ranko Mannen's dead?

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:21.790
That's what the pig gets for getting cocky.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.630
A thirty-six-year-old maid dying
feels like the end of an era.

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.250
Damn straight!

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:32.460
The other swine will be quick to follow
so she won't be alone for long.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:36.540
It just goes to show Akiba needs
more beef than pork, y'know?

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:37.790
'Kay, see ya.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.790
See moo.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:48.460
Where's the maid who killed Ranko?

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:50.630
You're that pig from Oinky Doink...

00:02:52.170 --> 00:02:53.750
Who did the job?

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.540
How the hell should I know, fucking hog?!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:03:00.000
Now we can tag your ear like the heifer you are.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.790
Guess we should go for a nose ring next?

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:05.040
A-all right, stop!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:06.960
I'll talk. I'll talk, okay?!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.960
Who's the one who killed Ranko?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.880
A-a maid who used to be at Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.460
Did the head give the order?

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.080
I don't know,

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:18.920
but the head's rounding up soldiers and weapons
to crush Oinky Doink Cafe.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.750
And where's the head right now?

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.080
Y-you think an underling maid like me would know?!

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.000
C'mon, let me off!

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:30.080
You go tell the other Creatures:

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:32.960
Nagomi Wahira is in mourning.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.580
I'm black pork now.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:39.630
DORAMA

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:48.630
I want to know about the maid named Uzuko
who used to work upstairs.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.630
Never heard of her.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.920
I don't have time for this!

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.920
Tell me where the head lives.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.130
Why the heck would I know that?

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.750
Her parents' address, then.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.880
Like I said, I don't know.

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.460
Is that Ranko's gun?

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.170
I'll tell you a bit about the past.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.290
DORAMA

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.290
Ramen

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.040
It was twenty-something years ago.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:19.830
A maid named Michiyo brought
an orphaned Uzuko home with her.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.580
Even as a kid, her eyes always looked
starved for something.

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:32.540
That was back when Michiyo was well-known
as a warmonger maid in Akiba.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.790
She intended to raise Uzuko as her successor.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:41.630
It wasn't until Ranko joined the cafe
that Michiyo changed.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:45.710
I think her innocent sincerity rubbed off on Michiyo.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:48.500
Michiyo changed her policy

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:52.880
to make the Maid Teahouse a cafe
that didn't rely on violence.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:58.670
But Uzuko couldn't bear to see
Michiyo give up violence.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:12.670
Chief!

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:20.170
So Uzuko arranged a hit on Michiyo and killed her.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.420
And now Ranko's dead as well.

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.540
Uzuko has no place to call home.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.830
So I reckon she doesn't even have an address.

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.330
Not that I'd know or anything.

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:35.170
She craves power because she's more afraid
of being alone than anyone.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.040
But that power is why she ends up alone.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.000
She's a sad, foolish creature.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.830
If you don't intend to eat, I need you to leave.

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:47.790
Sorry for th' trouble.

00:05:47.790 --> 00:05:49.040
You're not gonna eat?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.630
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.750
Nagomi! Where have you been?!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.830
You're still wearing that thing?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.580
You didn't even come to the funeral!

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:05.830
Hey!

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:07.460
Nagomi?

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:09.210
Where's the key?

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.500
The Chief has it.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.460
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:21.170
The Creatures are coming for us.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.250
For real?

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.540
We need weapons.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:25.960
So you're just gonna steal the cafe's money?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:27.540
We don't have any time!

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.580
If we don't get prepared quickly,
they'll just decimate us!

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.750
Just calm down a sec.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.920
How can you stay calm?!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.630
Aren't you all maids?!

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.250
They took out one of ours!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:42.580
If they kill one of ours, we get them back.
Isn't that what maids do?!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:43.580
Zoya, go get armed!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:44.580
But...

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.380
I'm gonna send as many goddamn
Creatures as I can to Hell,

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.420
then I'm gonna see Ranko there
with a smile on my face!

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:15.500
Nerula...

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:19.830
Please forgive me for having to change.

00:07:31.420 --> 00:07:33.460
Well, well, well...

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:36.630
You sure got me good the udder day, pigface!

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:39.830
You think a damn pig deserves to get all cocky?!
What's going on over there?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.290
Here, have anudder one!

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.380
Here's seconds!

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:52.380
So...

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:54.460
Are you satisfied?

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.500
That enough to satisfy you?

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.000
You're dead.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:03.420
...about?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.830
Is this all being a maid's about?

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:07.830
What's that?

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.130
All this threatening and beating and killing !

00:08:10.130 --> 00:08:11.540
Is that any fun?!

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:15.170
Do you enjoy making people scared of you?! Huh?!

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:16.380
The hell's wrong with her?

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:18.630
What's the point of being a maid?!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.500
Come on, tell me!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:22.830
She snapped from getting clobbered too much.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.960
I'll end her, right now.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:29.380
Hey, there's too many people around.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:30.580
You'd better not.

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:32.460
Fine.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.790
She's only got a few days left to live, anyway.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.290
Don't run from me!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.710
Aren't you maids?!

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:43.460
Hey! Let's have some more fun here!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.000
Akihabara

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.000
Police

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:47.000
Station

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.960
She should have just thrown this shabby thing away.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.420
Who keeps this kind of thing?

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.580
From the friendly baseball game

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:18.580
vs. the Axolotls

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.500
Is this dirt?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:20.580
That wasn't Koshien, jeez.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.040
Just look at how awful I look.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.960
Damn it, she wants us to raid the pigsty now?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.630
We don't have the time to prepare!

00:09:46.630 --> 00:09:48.960
Are you questioning the head's decision?

00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:50.170
That's not what I mean.

00:09:50.170 --> 00:09:53.750
Still, I have no idea what the head
is thinking these days.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.380
It's ever since that Ranko Mannen
got out of the joint.

00:09:56.380 --> 00:10:01.790
She disowned the pigsty, took them back,
and now she's trying to crush them again.

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:03.630
It's not easy to cope with.

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:04.630
True.

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:07.290
Maybe Miss Nagi's reign is coming to an end.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.580
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.960
Nagomi!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.380
Where the hell did you-

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.000
What the-

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.250
What happened to your face?!

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.750
Nagomi, we're ready to fight, too.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.460
It's to avenge Ranko.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:24.500
We'll take down as many as we can down with us.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:28.000
If it's war they want,
we've gotta grit our teeth and go for it.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.170
Nagomi?

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.920
At first, I wasn't so sure about Ranko.

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:37.290
She didn't have any moe, she looked dead serious,

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.170
and she killed people right off the bat.

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:44.170
But being a maid with Ranko was so much fun.

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:48.380
Ranko said that Oinky Doink was her family.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:51.210
I don't want to lose this place, either.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.880
But the Creatures are coming for us, aren't they?

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.380
It'll be a fight to the death.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.630
We're Creatures too, after all.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.790
Do you enjoy the way Oinky Doink is now?

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.790
Are your masters feeling the moe?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.630
Are the corners of your mouth turned upwards?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:12.500
My mouth is sad at times.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:14.580
But there's nothing we can do about it now.

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:17.880
I think there's something we can do,
precisely because we're maids.

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.380
You have something in mind?

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.130
We'll spring a maid war on them.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:37.170
Miss Nagi, would you consider
exterminating the pigs at a later date?

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.830
We haven't worked things out with the cops yet.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:43.130
If we cause much more bloodshed,
a fair number of maids will end up in the slammer.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:44.790
We stick to the plan.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.420
You mentioned you would be participating yourself.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:48.630
Are you serious?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:49.630
I am.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:52.420
Widdle teddy here thinks you shouldn't!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:54.130
If anything were to-

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.290
Bear?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.580
Moo?!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.630
Mooooo!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.210
Any maids who refuse to obey me can die.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.040
DORAMA

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.040
Ramen

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:20.080
Large ramen: extra veggies, topped with sauce
and a load of garlic. Six of 'em.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:22.040
No, make that seven.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.750
Sure.

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:42.830
Nagomi, lemme have a bite of that.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.420
I'd like some too.

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:45.630
Me too.

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:47.380
Can I have some too?

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.130
It's been a while, Uzuko.

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:10.210
Ranko's dead. She-

00:13:10.210 --> 00:13:12.290
I'm about to go exterminate the swine.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:13.500
Better get lost.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:17.290
Ranko still called you her sister.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.130
Stop talking.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:23.000
I just wish you and Ranko
could have had my ramen aga-

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.290
Dipping noodles are the new thing now.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:45.540
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.040
Let's go.

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.290
Welcome home to the pigsty!

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.290
Huh?!

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.880
Wow, I can't believe we have
so many mistresses here.

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.580
What a sweet, sweet surprise!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.670
Are you like, nervous 'cuz we're crazy cute?

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:16.540
C'mon, relax!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.420
There are lots of cute maids here
at Oinky Doink Cafe!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.630
What's that?!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:22.250
We've come to kill you.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.710
Thanks, oinky doink!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.080
But first, why not experience some moe
here at Oinky Doink Cafe?

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.080
Are you shitting us?!

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:31.250
Today is our Moe Moe Blam Campaign Day!

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:36.000
Any mistress with a gun can enjoy
all of our services for free!

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.290
Shall I kill them?

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.540
There's twenty-six of us.

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:41.330
Hamks so much, oink!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:43.880
You heard her. Sit.

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:51.080
This here is a brick house called Oinky Doink
where some cute little pigs live.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:54.500
So that we can become the finest
Iberico pork to feed the humans,

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:58.580
us piglets have been waiting to
serve all of you mistresses, oink!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.830
You messing with us, jackass?!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.920
Jackass? There are no rabbits or donkeys here.

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:04.580
It's just a house for pigs!

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.710
Miss Nagi, I heard you were once
a maid here in this location.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.880
That was a long time ago.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:14.630
Mistresses! Let me take your oinkders right away.

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.380
What would you suggest?

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:19.330
I would recommend the
Live Porkformance Oinky Doink Special!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.250
We'll get that for all of us.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.790
But once the performance is over, you all die.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.080
You have a discerning snout, Mistress!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:30.880
Watch as I make this drink here
extra tasty with a snort!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:34.920
When I say, "oinky-moe," you say, "snort snort," okay?

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.330
Ready, and, oinky-moe!

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.040
Snooort!

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.920
Getting embarrassed at a maid cafe is not oinkay!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:46.750
Especially you, Mistress!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.380
Get that scowl off your face!

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.920
That's it, you're asking for it!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.580
Don't. I'll kill her myself later.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.710
Thanks, oinky doink!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.750
It's like you've given up being human.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.790
Okay, here we go!

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.040
Oinky-moe!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.210
Snort, snort.

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:03.250
Doinky-moe!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.380
Snort, snort.

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:05.920
Oinky doink doink!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.130
Oh, yay!

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:10.580
Thanks to you all,
your drinks are now sow much tastier!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.130
How's this so good, damn it?

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:18.210
Why'd you turn off the lights?!

00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:19.540
Is this a trap, bastards?!

00:16:19.540 --> 00:16:21.210
You think we're gonna take this crap?!

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.420
Hey, everyone!
Hamks so much for coming!

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:32.130
I'm so hap-pig to see so many of you
here to see us today!

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.250
We're here to kill you, damn it!

00:16:34.250 --> 00:16:35.580
Thanks, oinky doink!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.830
I'm Nagomi Wahira, here to sing
like my life depends on it!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.330
Kirakira kawaiku zettai!
Sparkly and cute to the prime!

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:50.830
Kirameku watashi ni shoutai!
Come to me I'm sublime!

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:53.830
Zendai mimon no showtime! Understand?
Unprecedented showtime! Understand?

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.880
Kokokara hajimaru Cinderella story
This is where my Cinderella story starts, right here

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:00.080
What's this lame-ass dance?

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.080
I can't tell if you're singing or snorting!
What's this lame-ass dance?

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.380
I can't tell if you're singing or snorting!
We want our money back!

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.330
Tsukareta sono kokoroni
If ever your soul is feeling worn out

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.290
Present agetaino
Let me give a present just for you

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.920
Egao mo sono namida mo
This lovely smile, and even those tears

00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:11.710
Zenbukagayaku ai desu
There's sparkly love infused in them all

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.920
Douzo!
Here you go!

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.920
She needs sharper moves.

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.460
Wait, hold on!

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:19.130
You need sharper moves.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:21.670
That part there should go like this.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.500
Oh, I get it now.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.250
You're so very good at this, Uzuko.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:29.380
I do hope I'll be a wonderful maid like you someday!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:32.580
Mujun fujun the otome gokoro
Contrary, tricky, that's how a girl's heart works!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.750
Wagamama kana?
Maybe that's selfish, huh?

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.960
Gomennasai
I'm sorry

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:49.000
...ni mirai o makeup!
...make up my own future

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.880
Minna ikkuyo!
Come on, everyone!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.710
Kanaetai negai wa
So many dreams! To make come true!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:57.420
Iroiro arukedo ima wa
I gotta strive to pursue

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:00.500
Donna jibun ni datte narerumade
Right now, you never know who I'll get to be

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:02.460
Wa wakaranai desho
Until the day comes I'm who I want to be

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.170
Nandemo kandemo damedame demo daijoubu
Even if everything just plain sucks, it's tolerable

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:08.040
Chakkari shikkari kikkari mada powerful
Topped it, got it, on it, I'm still powerful

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:10.710
Junbi wa iidesu ka?
Are you all ready to go?

00:18:10.710 --> 00:18:14.250
Kira kira no watashi afuredasu sekai
Just watch me as I sparkle, see my world taking over

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:19.170
Dokidoki de harahara de mainichi busy! Oh my god!
So exciting, what a thrill! Everyday busy, oh my god!

00:18:19.170 --> 00:18:21.920
Kirakira de wakuwaku de kimochi wa eien ni seventeen
So much sparkle, heart a-glow! Inside I always feel seventeen

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:24.670
Dokidoki de harahara de meiwaku sorry! Goaikyou!
So exciting, what a thrill! Sorry for the trouble, it's part of the fun!

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:27.460
Kirakira de wakuwaku de subete ni koisuru pretty heart!
So much sparkle, heart a-glow! A pretty heart adores it all!

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:29.830
Aishite
Love me do

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.630
Miss Nagi...

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:02.290
Their applause means nothing.

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:08.130
So much has happened since I've come to Akiba.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.630
I've seen maids who were terrifying die,

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:14.630
and I've seen maids who were dear to me die as well.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:19.960
Everyone on all sides killed so many
to avenge the maids who died.

00:19:22.130 --> 00:19:25.250
But I don't think that's any fun.

00:19:26.460 --> 00:19:28.790
Why should maids have to hit each other?

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.460
How does using guns help spread moe?

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.210
If you don't pull the trigger, you get killed.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.080
You need to be strong to survive here in Akiba.

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.420
A maid either takes or gets taken.

00:19:40.210 --> 00:19:41.880
A maid's job is to serve others.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.790
Like a maid I respect once said:

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:51.290
"Oinky Doink Cafe is hap-pig to serve as
a home to all masters anytime, oink!"

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.170
Welcome home, Mistress.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.210
Welcome home?

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.420
That's right.

00:20:01.710 --> 00:20:05.000
Starting today, this is your home, Uzuko.

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.710
Cut the sentimental crap.

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.210
In the end, a maid is ultimately alone.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:19.540
Mistress, if you ever feel lonely,
please try coming home to Oinky Doink Cafe again.

00:20:19.880 --> 00:20:22.920
I promise you we'll make you feel the moe moe kyun!

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.880
Nagomi, was it?

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:32.290
Yes!

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:36.500
You're a shitty maid who doesn't even
come close to Miss Michiyo.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.920
A maid who's exactly like Ranko.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:43.000
Oh, well...

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:44.790
That's such an honor, oink.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:49.670
Mistress, were you able to enjoy Oinky Doink Cafe?

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:58.710
Nagomi!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:20:59.710
Nagomi!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.080
Nagomi!

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:39.580
Another day, another chance to go moe moe kyun
Kyou mo ashita mo moe moe kyun

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:45.960
I come to the pigsty for my moe moe kyun
Butagoya atari de moe moe kyun

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:52.000
That's the sort of life I lead
Sorega atai no ikizama sa

00:21:53.210 --> 00:22:01.790
Mock me, and you just might bleed
Baka ni suru yatsa chi o miruze

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:07.380
Is the hesitation that wells up
Mune o yogiru tamerai wa

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:16.210
The lingering scent of a humane soul?
Hito no kokoro no nokoriga ka

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:23.290
Whether you get to live or die
Ikirutomo haterutomo

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:29.080
Tread your own path
Onore no michi o tsuranuke

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:35.500
Have the guts to pull that trigger
Hikigane o hiki yagare

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:41.830
Who are you
Omae ga dare nanoka

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:48.750
Show me through the pain
Itami de oshietokure

00:22:53.830 --> 00:22:56.000
AKIHABARA

00:23:03.500 --> 00:23:05.040
You probably don't know,

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:07.500
but Akiba used to be a really rough neighborhood.

00:23:07.500 --> 00:23:09.000
With gunfights and all that.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:11.210
Gunfights in Akiba? Seriously?!

00:23:11.210 --> 00:23:13.170
Doesn't seem possible now, does it?

00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:14.170
No.

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.920
New Oinky Doink Cafe

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:20.170
So why this cafe in particular?

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:22.630
To see our favorite maid, of course.

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:24.750
A favorite, huh?
What kind of maid is she?

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:26.540
A thirty-six-year-old maid.

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:27.920
What?! Thirty-six years old?!

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.130
Oh, here she comes.

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:37.920
Welcome home, Master!
